{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50094","headline":"石上阁 · 无名氏","name":"石上阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石上构层阁，便以石爲柱。\n千载□栋梁，岂有□危惧。\n苔壁绝人踪，虹桥横鸟路。\n攀涉惬所怀，幽奇未尝遇。\n迥然半空里，物象竞相助。\n云外见孤峯，林端悬瀑布。\n引望无不通，兹焉倍多趣。\n徒□欲忘归，衣裳湿烟雾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}